			)
			(embedded_fonts no)
		)
	)
	(text "GATE AND LED DRIVE: A CLOSED SWITCH TAKES ITS LINE TO +5 V.\nLC_G AND TX_G PULL TO -5 V, AND ALSO LIGHT THE LEDS OF\nS1'S AND S2'S PHOTORELAYS (EXCITATION). S8_G IS PULLED\nDOWN AT ITS GATE; S9_G LIGHTS S9'S LED THROUGH 680R\nTO COM (FRONT END)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 63.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "1351f1c4-9df1-559b-a0b0-9ef9028d8d44")
	)
	(text "SWITCH ENABLES: GPIO0..GPIO5 OF THE CONVERTER, ACTIVE HIGH.\nLC: S1, S3, S5 (LOAD CELL)   PRT: S6 (PIEZORESISTIVE)\nTX: S2, S4, S7 (TRANSMITTER)   CAL: S10 (SHUNT CALIBRATION)\nS8: 4-20 mA SHUNT   S9: VOLTAGE DIVIDER\nTHE TMUX6212'S OWN 4M PULL-DOWNS: AN UNDRIVEN LINE READS OFF.\nNO HARDWARE INTERLOCK: THE FPGA WRITES ONLY THE\nCOMBINATIONS OF THE CONFIGURATION TABLE (GW-2)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 25.4 30.48 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "54c7d781-1b11-50d0-bc2b-a7e4a4095ff7")
	)
	(text "SWITCHES"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 20.32 158.75 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify bottom)
		)
		(uuid "d176af16-f83d-5798-bd3c-f19ce942d936")
	)
	(text "REFP: S5 FROM EXC+ THROUGH 10k (LOAD CELL),\nS6 FROM EXC- (PIEZORESISTIVE),\nS7 FROM THE BUS (TRANSMITTERS)"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 48.26 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e5e91180-aec5-5da3-908a-6d0b05778365")
	)
	(text "S10: SHUNT CALIBRATION, RCAL ACROSS\nTHE SIG+ TO EXC- ARM; 87.6k\nSIMULATES ABOUT 1 mV/V ON A 350R CELL"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 190.5 96.52 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e616481b-2090-59f4-aa19-b5d42dd00407")
	)
